{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49430","headline":"临江仙 六 · 牛希济","name":"临江仙 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳带摇风汉水滨，平芜两岸争匀。\n鸳鸯对浴浪痕新。\n弄珠游女，微笑自含春。\n轻步暗移蝉鬓动，罗帬风惹轻尘。\n水精宫殿岂无因。\n空劳纤手，解佩赠情人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}